{"seq":2,"slug":"supply-chain-traceability-ntier","title":"供应链溯源与 N 级映射（BOM 穿透、冶炼厂/产地级追溯）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-esg-diversity-sourcing-compliance/supply-chain-esg-risk/supply-chain-traceability-ntier","wordCount":2916,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"供应链溯源与-n-级映射-bom-穿透-冶炼厂-产地级追溯\">供应链溯源与 N 级映射（BOM 穿透、冶炼厂/产地级追溯）</h1><p>一张采购订单签发出去，买方的合同相对方是 Tier-1 组装厂。但 ESG 风险的所在地几乎从不在 Tier-1：童工可能在 Tier-3 的纺纱厂，冲突矿产可能来自 Tier-5 的一座刚果（金）冶炼厂，森林砍伐可能发生在 Tier-6 的一块马来西亚棕榈园地块。Tier-1 的 ESG 合规不能推出 Tier-N 的合规，因此「供应链 ESG 风险」的第一个工程问题不是打分，而是<strong>先把链路看见</strong>——把不透明的上游展开成一张可查询、可追溯、可归属风险的图。本文讲这张图怎么建、BOM 怎么穿透、冶炼厂与地块级锚点怎么落。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>供应链溯源（traceability）</strong> 指把成品与它的各级上游投入物、参与主体、生产地点建立可回溯的关联，并能对「某批原料流向哪些成品」做正向查询、对「某成品含哪些原料」做反向穿透。<strong>N 级映射（N-tier mapping）</strong> 是它的数据结构形态：把供应链展开为从成品到第 N 层的图，每层记录主体、场所与物料。<strong>BOM 穿透（BOM penetration）</strong> 是从物料清单出发递归展开、抵达目标粒度的那次遍历。<strong>冶炼厂级追溯（smelter-level）</strong> 是矿产类风险的收敛点——矿石熔炼后无法物理分离，冶炼厂/精炼厂是熔炼批次可登记的最上游可辨识单元。<strong>产地级（plot-level）</strong> 是更细的粒度，直接落到农田地块坐标。四者构成一条从「看见链路」到「锚定风险」的工程链。</p>\n<h2 id=\"供应链溯源的图模型-节点-边与层级\">供应链溯源的图模型：节点、边与层级</h2><p>溯源数据天然是一张有向无环图（DAG），而不是一棵树。同一家冶炼厂可以同时供货给多个 Tier-2 加工商，多个成品共用同一颗芯片——树模型会重复计数，DAG 才能表达共享与汇聚。</p>\n<p>节点有三类语义，混用是常见的数据建模错误：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>节点类型</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>典型标识符</th>\n<th>例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>法律实体（operator）</td>\n<td>签约与担责主体</td>\n<td>LEI（<a href=\"https://www.gleif.org/\">GLEIF</a>）、DUNS</td>\n<td>「XX 精密制造有限公司」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>场所（facility/site）</td>\n<td>物理生产地点</td>\n<td>GS1 GLN（<a href=\"https://www.gs1.org/standards/id-keys/gln\">GS1</a>）、地址坐标</td>\n<td>广东东莞某工厂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>物料/批次（item/lot）</td>\n<td>流转物</td>\n<td>GTIN + 批号、矿物 CID 编号</td>\n<td>一批阴极铜、一炉锡</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>边表示「供货/加工」关系，携带时间窗、数量、以及<strong>溯源置信度</strong>。层级（tier）不是节点属性而是<strong>相对于某个锚点成品的距离</strong>：同一家冶炼厂，对 A 产品是 Tier-4，对 B 产品可能是 Tier-2。把 tier 硬编码进供应商主数据是设计缺陷，正确做法是从锚点做图遍历时动态计算。</p>\n<p>层级还有一个关键区分：<strong>直接供应商（direct supplier）</strong> 与 <strong>上游参与者（upstream actor）</strong>。欧盟《企业可持续尽职调查指令》（CSDDD，Directive (EU) 2024/1760，<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/dir/2024/1760/oj\">eur-lex</a>）把尽职调查义务沿「活动链（chain of activities）」向上游延伸，但义务强度随距离衰减——Tier-1 需直接尽调，更上游则要求「合理可得（reasonable available）」的努力。这条法律梯度直接决定了工程投入应集中在哪几层。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  P[成品 SKU] --&gt; T1[Tier-1 组装厂]&#10;  T1 --&gt; T2a[Tier-2 模组厂 A]&#10;  T1 --&gt; T2b[Tier-2 模组厂 B]&#10;  T2a --&gt; T3a[Tier-3 元器件厂]&#10;  T2b --&gt; T3a&#10;  T3a --&gt; T4[冶炼厂 / 精炼厂]&#10;  T4 --&gt; T5[矿区 / 地块]&#10;  T4 -.共享.-&gt; SH[另一成品的上游]&#10;  T5 --&gt; G[地理坐标 / 地块 ID]\">graph TD\n  P[成品 SKU] --&gt; T1[Tier-1 组装厂]\n  T1 --&gt; T2a[Tier-2 模组厂 A]\n  T1 --&gt; T2b[Tier-2 模组厂 B]\n  T2a --&gt; T3a[Tier-3 元器件厂]\n  T2b --&gt; T3a\n  T3a --&gt; T4[冶炼厂 / 精炼厂]\n  T4 --&gt; T5[矿区 / 地块]\n  T4 -.共享.-&gt; SH[另一成品的上游]\n  T5 --&gt; G[地理坐标 / 地块 ID]</pre><h2 id=\"bom-穿透算法-递归展开与物料级映射\">BOM 穿透算法：递归展开与物料级映射</h2><p><strong>BOM 穿透（BOM penetration）</strong> 指从成品物料清单出发，递归展开每一层的组成件，直到抵达目标粒度（物料、冶炼厂或地块）。它本质是一次带权重的图遍历。</p>\n<p>设成品 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 的单位用量下，组件 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 的直接用量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_{p,c}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（来自 BOM 行）。则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 对任意下游物料 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 的<strong>累计物料强度</strong>满足递归：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>children</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></munder><msub><mi>q</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>Q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q(p, m) = \\sum_{c \\in \\text{children}(p)} q_{p,c} \\cdot Q(c, m), \\quad Q(m, m) = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.566em;vertical-align:-1.516em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">children</span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个式子揭示两件事。第一，穿透深度会<strong>指数放大</strong>节点数：若每层平均 8 个上游，5 层就是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>8</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>32768</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8^5 \\approx 32768</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32768</span></span></span></span></span> 条路径，必须靠共享节点去重（DAG 归并）而非逐路径展开。第二，任何一层的用量缺失都会让整条路径的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 不可信——所以工程上要区分「已确认无此物料」与「数据缺失」，两者在风险计算中方向相反。</p>\n<p>在关系库里，穿透用递归 CTE 表达，核心是<strong>深度上限 + 环检测 + 路径累积</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH RECURSIVE trace AS (&#10;  SELECT child_id AS node, parent_id, 1 AS depth, ARRAY[parent_id] AS path&#10;  FROM bom_edge WHERE parent_id = :anchor&#10;  UNION ALL&#10;  SELECT e.child_id, e.parent_id, t.depth + 1, t.path || e.parent_id&#10;  FROM bom_edge e JOIN trace t ON e.parent_id = t.node&#10;  WHERE t.depth &lt; :max_depth AND NOT e.child_id = ANY(t.path)&#10;)&#10;SELECT node, MIN(depth) AS tier FROM trace GROUP BY node;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> RECURSIVE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trace </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> child_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node, parent_id, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> depth, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ARRAY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[parent_id] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> path</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bom_edge </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> parent_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :anchor</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNION ALL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">child_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">parent_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">depth</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">path</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">parent_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bom_edge e </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trace t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">parent_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">node</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">depth</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :max_depth </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">child_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ANY(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">MIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(depth) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tier </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trace </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>深度上限不是性能优化而是<strong>正确性边界</strong>：超过你能验证的层数之后数据开始不可核验，强行展开只会产生看似完整实则虚构的链路。成熟实践把「可验证深度」显式记录为数据属性，而非默认无限展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"冶炼厂与产地级追溯-从-3tg-到-eudr-地块\">冶炼厂与产地级追溯：从 3TG 到 EUDR 地块</h2><p>对矿产类风险，穿透的<strong>收敛点</strong>是冶炼厂/精炼厂（smelter/refiner）。原因很实用：矿石交易后完全混同，无法用物理手段追溯原始矿区，但冶炼厂是熔炼批次可登记的最上游可辨识单元。OECD《受冲突影响和高风险地区矿产负责任供应链尽职调查指南》（<a href=\"https://www.oecd.org/\">OECD</a>）正是以「识别并公开冶炼厂」作为核心要求。</p>\n<p>工程锚点有三套：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>冶炼厂名录</strong>：负责任矿产倡议（RMI）的 RMAP 审核名单与 Smelter Look-up，用 CID 编号唯一标识每个冶炼厂（<a href=\"https://www.responsiblemineralsinitiative.org/\">RMI</a>）。采购方要求 Tier-N 供应商申报「你的锡来自名录中哪几个 CID」，把开放图收敛为可核对的离散集合。</li>\n<li><strong>认证/标签链路</strong>：LBMA Responsible Gold Guidance 约束金精炼厂，ITSCI 用标签追踪 3TG 在冲突区的流转。这些机制的价值在于<strong>它们已经做了收敛</strong>，你接入的是结论而非原始数据。</li>\n<li><strong>共址与时间证据</strong>：ILO 童工、SMETA 工时缺陷等风险需要场所坐标与审计日期做空间-时间匹配——审计结论只有挂到具体场所才有意义。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>产地级（plot-level）追溯的代表是欧盟《无毁林产品条例》（EUDR，Regulation (EU) 2023/1115，<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2023/1115/oj\">eur-lex</a>）。它要求大豆、牛肉、棕榈油、木材、咖啡、可可、橡胶七类商品提供生产<strong>地块的经纬度坐标</strong>，并对大于 4 公顷的地块要求多边形边界。这是溯源粒度从「工厂」降到「田块」的质变：数据模型要支撑 GeoJSON 多边形、卫星影像比对与「坐标能否证明无 2020-12-31 后毁林」的时间序列判断。EUDR 的分阶段适用时间已由 Regulation (EU) 2024/3234 推迟——大型运营商自 2025 年底、微型和小型企业自 2026 年中起适用，引用具体截止日应以欧盟当期公告为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"监管义务矩阵与数据粒度要求\">监管义务矩阵与数据粒度要求</h2><p>溯源不是自愿的透明化，而是多条法规的<strong>数据交付义务</strong>。下表把主要制度与它要求的溯源粒度对齐，是设计数据模型时的输入清单：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>制度</th>\n<th>管辖区</th>\n<th>要求的溯源粒度</th>\n<th>关键数据字段</th>\n<th>时间锚点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>EUDR (EU) 2023/1115</td>\n<td>欧盟</td>\n<td>地块级</td>\n<td>经纬度/多边形、生产日期、毁林核查</td>\n<td>大型运营商 2025 年底起</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EU 电池法规 (EU) 2023/1542</td>\n<td>欧盟</td>\n<td>批次 + 材料级</td>\n<td>碳足迹、再生料比例、电池护照</td>\n<td>电池护照约 2027-02 起</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EU 冲突矿产 (EU) 2017/821</td>\n<td>欧盟</td>\n<td>冶炼厂级</td>\n<td>3TG 来源、冶炼厂清单</td>\n<td>2021 年起适用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CBAM (EU) 2023/956</td>\n<td>欧盟</td>\n<td>物料 + 工序级</td>\n<td>嵌入排放、前体物用量</td>\n<td>过渡期至 2025 年底，2026 起正式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CSDDD (EU) 2024/1760</td>\n<td>欧盟</td>\n<td>活动链层级</td>\n<td>上游参与者、风险已识别证据</td>\n<td>分阶段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UFLPA（美国）</td>\n<td>美国</td>\n<td>供应链映射</td>\n<td>全链条溯源至原料，可反驳推定</td>\n<td>2022 起</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>德国 LkSG</td>\n<td>德国</td>\n<td>直接 + 间接供应商</td>\n<td>人权/环境风险、补救措施</td>\n<td>2023 起</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>矩阵里出现一个跨法规的工程复用点：<strong>同一份「前体物用量 + 来源」数据同时是 CBAM 嵌入排放、电池碳足迹与 EUDR 产地的输入</strong>。如果每个合规项目各自建一套供应商问卷，同一供应商会在三个系统里填出三份互相矛盾的答案。正确架构是建<strong>一份规范化 N 级溯源图</strong>，各合规报告从图上按不同投影抽取——这是把合规成本从「N 条法规」压到「一张图」的关键。</p>\n<h2 id=\"链路完整性的度量与工程实现\">链路完整性的度量与工程实现</h2><p>「链路可见」不能靠感觉，需要可量化指标。对层级 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 定义<strong>溯源覆盖率</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">∣</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>:</mo><mtext>resolved</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">∣</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_k = \\frac{\\big|\\{s \\in T_k : \\text{resolved}(s)\\}\\big|}{|T_k|}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.526em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.59em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.74em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.2em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.2em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1200\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v0 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v0 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v0 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">resolved</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)}</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.85em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.85em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:1.2em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"1.2em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 1200\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v0 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v0 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v0 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.35em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 层已知节点集合，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>resolved</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{resolved}(s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">resolved</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 表示该节点已被某份可核验证据（审计报告、冶炼厂申报、产地证书）锚定。实践中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 常接近 1，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 骤降至 30–60%，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 以后往往低于 20%——这个衰减曲线本身就是需向监管与客户披露的风险事实。</p>\n<p>风险沿图<strong>向上传播</strong>（下游继承上游最坏情形），可建模为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">(</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>up</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></munder><msub><mi>α</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_i = \\max\\Big( r_i,\\; \\max_{j \\in \\text{up}(i)} \\alpha_{j \\to i} \\cdot R_j \\Big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.116em;vertical-align:-0.966em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.309em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">up</span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.966em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">→</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是节点自身风险分，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 是传播折减（考虑数量占比与数据置信度，通常 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>）。用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span></span> 而非求和是审慎选择：风险是「最薄弱环节」性质，一条链上有一个冲突矿产冶炼厂整条链就暴露，数量加权平均会稀释掉这个信号。</p>\n<p>工程实现的三个务实约束：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>数据交换标准化</strong>。用 WBCSD PACT Pathfinder（<a href=\"https://www.wbcsd.org/\">WBCSD</a>）或 Catena-X（<a href=\"https://catena-x.net/\">catena-x.net</a>）的数据交换规范替代逐家邮件问卷，把「供应商填报」变成「节点间 API 交换」。汽车行业由 Together for Sustainability（<a href=\"https://www.tfs-initiative.com/\">TfS</a>）推动的共享评估也是同一思路。</li>\n<li><strong>来源与置信度是一等字段</strong>。每个节点/边必须带 <code>source</code>、<code>evidence_date</code>、<code>confidence</code>。问卷自报易造假，第三方审计可靠但高成本，卫星遥感客观但有分辨率边界——三者不可等权。</li>\n<li><strong>缺口清单要能驱动行动</strong>。系统输出不该是「覆盖率 42%」，而是「Tier-2 这 17 个节点缺冶炼厂申报，其中 5 个是高风险国别」——可执行的待办比抽象的比例更能推动供应商配合。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>最后一条把溯源与本章其他环节接上：溯源图产出的节点-风险向量，是后续供应商 ESG 评分与合规报告的数据底座；审计结论需挂到具体场所才有意义（详见 <a href=\"../esg-supplier-qualification-data/thirdparty-esg-audit-scoring\">第三方 ESG 审计与评分归一化</a>）。没有 N 级映射，下游所有 ESG 分数都只是在给 Tier-1 画像，而上游的真实风险从未进入视野。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>供应链溯源的核心工程判断是三条。其一，<strong>用 DAG 而非树</strong>建模，tier 是从锚点动态计算的相对距离，不是供应商主数据里的静态字段。其二，<strong>穿透有收敛点</strong>：矿产类风险把冶炼厂/精炼厂作为最上游可辨识单元，用 RMI CID 名录把开放图压成可核对集合；农产品类风险则下沉到 EUDR 的地块坐标与多边形。其三，<strong>合规数据要一次建模多次投影</strong>——CBAM 前体物、电池碳足迹、EUDR 产地共享同一份 N 级溯源图，避免同一供应商填出互相矛盾的多套问卷。余下的量化抓手是分层覆盖率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与向上传播的风险 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，它们让「链路可见」从主观判断变成可披露、可驱动行动的数据。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"供应链溯源与 N 级映射（BOM 穿透、冶炼厂/产地级追溯）","id":"供应链溯源与-n-级映射-bom-穿透-冶炼厂-产地级追溯"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"供应链溯源的图模型：节点、边与层级","id":"供应链溯源的图模型-节点-边与层级"},{"level":2,"text":"BOM 穿透算法：递归展开与物料级映射","id":"bom-穿透算法-递归展开与物料级映射"},{"level":2,"text":"冶炼厂与产地级追溯：从 3TG 到 EUDR 地块","id":"冶炼厂与产地级追溯-从-3tg-到-eudr-地块"},{"level":2,"text":"监管义务矩阵与数据粒度要求","id":"监管义务矩阵与数据粒度要求"},{"level":2,"text":"链路完整性的度量与工程实现","id":"链路完整性的度量与工程实现"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"供应链 ESG 风险分类与分级评分（强迫劳动/森林砍伐/冲突矿产/碳）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-esg-diversity-sourcing-compliance/supply-chain-esg-risk/esg-risk-taxonomy-scoring"},"next":{"title":"高风险事件响应、整改与退出（扣关/暂停/替代供应）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-esg-diversity-sourcing-compliance/supply-chain-esg-risk/risk-event-remediation-exit"}}